# Top-down sofa (issue 047, flipped after playtest): seen from behind and above. The oak back rail and its fabric back panel are on the near (bottom) side facing the player; the two seat cushions (with a seam) and the oak arms lie farther away, against the south wall. 6x2 tiles. The poses replace one or two 16-wide columns of this.
size: 96x32
